s ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21FeFRqZExRME0xYTFGWVVVSTFVM0ZMVXkxTlYzYxAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105543156097389126953/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1782682236935610,"updated_at_unix_micros":1782682236935610,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"Lovely friendly, attentive staff - our order was taken promptly and we had the most delicious loose leaf tea, millionaire shortbread and salted caramel brownie after a busy day of shopping in Manchester. It was the end of the day, they’d obviously had a busy time of weekend brunches but still made us feel welcome and gave us the heads up immediately on what was available.\nReally nice calm oasis in a beautiful old arcade, welcome respite from the busy streets around.","text_translated":"","published_at":"2026-06-28T21:30:36.93561Z"},{"Name":"William Donaldson","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgq9CvdgcXul9Nqsq2eJN2s7qU5W-0KuiraWMbUzXPiK9XdfRzJw=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","Rating":5,"Description":"Pot Kettle Black is the jewel in the brunch crown of Manchester. I had one of their specials and it was frankly the best brunch I've ever had. Service was with style and grace, and despite feeling like I'd waited a while (even though I'd booked a spot) I can't fault the quality of service or the food.\nMy only gripe would be that it felt a little cold, so bring a scarf but you'd be mad not to eat here.","Images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmOa8SuvG_y7-ttF5L1RBIZzNgjjpJH7ad9ctUyMzDrr4YGrAyHFnVWKTI4wbgyN2FMgBHvc5qT8wTtC7JP0xqP4JFik20FQ6wLUXK5RXEw5biV82GyIaayGK_vx5cssjrT8UNjdRaWEgnRu=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNcP_QJQDWkVOwY987Q-iXqxA0k8XBsDfhy-bOX_nAxTX0n0V0x39ZGncqRD40zgCPrc8_EULJzj-A8hk1wECmGIwx4YeXN5pSHVL_CYs_tnFp0e3I1Nx_gskGS5SqCwqo0BtsxXTtvme2e=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmN6L0kjuP6toc2kT5Dmd09ab31Beczo-iS3Ru_NboAuC8zePv_49uhxcF3PMi2gSkzFwbYEuk7BAZEHzuhS9nl0l6HbPbXdT8J3yShHrgTV4DhqZ6p5vRAozwIIPS8hWAwuq3qJgQRjsYD1=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPv2hIDTJc1I7PMlE9eMTPqJXWsPrqeeycAxwUmanVuoQAwznTNC5CLNDgBE0zuJJDOJMG0Si2rOfUEmwPvf1B8oU_wBzKlvVsR_dkiv00FPTUKAUeQu3OGHjshIXQUoaO1k5MCEg2lH-w=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPFVPiZWXfVeKwEehNVLh6u62q6MMZnUBVVZApJnP6S88yBv2TLt0NK5i-DIzwiSyOAAFzR4-BfwwzwI_gSXnluVMBj6_v1zn-26mX7PrDecHFl8P8-DF0S_KaV0j_aBONLEcxw3hNzWFlm=k-no"],"When":"10 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsMWQxaGFXVGRzTlVoeFVWTkhaekpsYW5KNmJFRRAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106272077505231762638/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1764263834707508,"updated_at_unix_micros":1764263834707508,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"Pot Kettle Black is the jewel in the brunch crown of Manchester. I had one of their specials and it was frankly the best brunch I've ever had. Service was with style and grace, and despite feeling like I'd waited a while (even though I'd booked a spot) I can't fault the quality of service or the food.\nMy only gripe would be that it felt a little cold, so bring a scarf but you'd be mad not to eat here.","text_translated":"","published_at":"2025-11-27T17:17:14.707508Z"},{"Name":"Andrew Mckernan","ProfilePicture":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoGTdSiwBCK8n1WFiHBGVjaHX22K5bKqAXPA2roeB94xv-5tWV=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","Rating":5,"Description":"Its a perfect little cafe. A nice setting with variety of seating, high table and stools normal tables , shared tables, inside and outside( but still inside the center). The food was exceptional ( sweet and savoury). They mixed up my order and were super apologetic, gave 50% off ( i assumed it was off my food but it was the whole bill 🤯 £28 quid saved even after I pointed out they had served what would have been my second choice). The staff were lovely, food came out fast. The coffee and smoothies were also spot on. 10/10 would be back if im ever in Manchester again\nEdit. Went back today before we got the train, had the other special blackpudding bennny, it was outrageously good. So much going on but it was even better than the ither one 6 out of 5","Images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmPli_TOh98lhqxwuundwPwv_fbkdkFyNOwIgNZTAXZayEQ57ibqo80b9-pjV489Adc1C3y6r1L8U7fbLD-IJbdrhjjyKrXLhdNVTV2SL96ncQrT-tf86W5zRXTfdxjUfPlBTtvwbsh7TE6q=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMBPOd-iZKStL82mUxt4SL9LZZT-i4XBMIiN71n2x1RREafkpwXtrRsojvAS2dyn2HPHZCJ8jGqaJ0tvd-Id6XKa9kHtzAxwM37RKLN77iryOY7YRX2LwoxCJEANeKJ0YlF6H51Ndh3tnw=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmMGGjkKGuTA1f6AEwYbYt_625ZJeF9fMazCmnVk-PQilmIxFkfLGg2CD_T9DUmWQ2T28LD_n-4vGngcH7Bg-zRtkGMo0V7u1EGtjTHy-6eECwFETafBEbiIo99jadm33VoHJvfCdfdT7xoB=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNgLYtHYqPO2MPTtkFZ4MVmyD26zONY7POe3ErcQryUZ26JpOvm0OYTTLVQjC4jL9UEM8SuKtYxbSTvToY-7CHV5ebJlVZMNxBxl6jRXDpRv7T0uVu-F_BK4R_I3kqfTF8xk6vu_n4IXWPV=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNqgj3sKckfdJntUHLX0fltdlcuYFFhQRmy36TCFe-vDZaL9qNzEwFKrVjdd3JvWr8cMn2zDbs2bQScR93ZpV71SyGKDgy2iWaTEhO71aIRIuzlr_wMPbKIXjTA1S1iFTz1YJjksPd4Cl-7=k-no"],"When":"9 months ago","review_id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKamRsbDRTRlZHY0dseVRVUjRNVU5tVlZSdWJFRRAB","source":"Google","rating_scale":5,"rating_float":5,"author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102446825086635741829/reviews?hl=en-GB","posted_at_unix_micros":1765880905121770,"updated_at_unix_micros":1765891032472834,"language":"en","translated_lang":"","text_original":"Its a perfect little cafe. A nice setting with variety of seating, high table and stools normal tables , shared tables, inside and outside( but still inside the center). The food was exceptional ( sweet and savoury). They mixed up my order and were super apologetic, gave 50% off ( i assumed it was off my food but it was the whole bill 🤯 £28 quid saved even after I pointed out they had served what would have been my second choice). The staff were lovely, food came out fast. The coffee and smoothies were also spot on. 10/10 would be back if im ever in Manchester again\nEdit. Went back today before we got the train, had the other special blackpudding bennny, it was outrageously good. So much going on but it was even better than the ither one 6 out of 5","text_translated":"","published_at":"2025-12-16T10:28:25.12177Z"}],"user_reviews_extended":null,"emails":null}
